{"seq":2,"slug":"debates","title":"Debates","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/debates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-wild-chan-critique","title":"近禅之讥与狂禅流弊","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/the-wild-chan-critique","wordCount":1789,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"action-and-quietism","title":"事功与心性之辩","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/action-and-quietism","wordCount":1724,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章审视围绕王阳明的两场争议。&quot;近禅之讥&quot;——王阳明心学因高扬&quot;心&quot;、注重内在体悟而被批评为&quot;近禅&quot;，其后学更有&quot;狂禅&quot;流弊；本章辨析了儒禅之别，指出王阳明心学根本精神是彻底的儒家。&quot;事功与心性之辩&quot;——则揭示王阳明如何完美地统一了内圣与外王、心学与事功，成为&quot;知行合一&quot;的最高典范。本章以全面的态度辨析这些争议。</p>\n"}